    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Ready to become a gravekeeper? Experience the cemetery management simulation in <i>Me the Gravekeeper</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaeYou won\u2019t just protect the graves from various obstacles but also take full control of managing your own graveyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u26cf\ufe0fEach body that arrives must be given a proper burial and that means digging the grave yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26b0\ufe0fAfter digging, you\u2019ll need to carry the corpse to its grave. Or, make your life easier by hiring pallbearers to do the heavy lifting for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Decorate your graves with lamps, statues, fences, and other ornaments to raise their value and sell them for a higher price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf38 Pick flowers growing around your cemetery and sell them at your flower shop for extra income. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc74You\u2019ll be personally trained by Grandpa himself, and of course, you'll become his successor as the gravekeeper.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf\u00a0Graveyard full? No problem! When a body decomposes, just clean up the plot and put it back on the market. Recycling at its finest!<br></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Ready to become a gravekeeper? Experience the cemetery management simulation in <i>Me the Gravekeeper</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaeYou won\u2019t just protect the graves from various obstacles but also take full control of managing your own graveyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u26cf\ufe0fEach body that arrives must be given a proper burial and that means digging the grave yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26b0\ufe0fAfter digging, you\u2019ll need to carry the corpse to its grave. Or, make your life easier by hiring pallbearers to do the heavy lifting for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Decorate your graves with lamps, statues, fences, and other ornaments to raise their value and sell them for a higher price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf38 Pick flowers growing around your cemetery and sell them at your flower shop for extra income. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc74You\u2019ll be personally trained by Grandpa himself, and of course, you'll become his successor as the gravekeeper.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf\u00a0Graveyard full? No problem! When a body decomposes, just clean up the plot and put it back on the market. Recycling at its finest!<br></p>",
